      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AUSSIE MOSS (7) comes here off a placing in fast time (25.09) over 450m at Ballarat when beaten 4 lengths in a Grade 4/5. Has the ability and looks a key chance again. IMPRINT (6) turned in a strong run last time, placing in a Grade 5 when second behind Cheeky Chompers in a sharp 30.03 and setting a new course and distance PB. Should be in this for a long way. PAW FABIAN (1) ran below best last time finishing fourth (25.44) over 450m at Ballarat from Box 6. Goes very well from this draw with six wins and four minor placings from 15 starts. Expected to feature in the finish. SPRING MILES (2) is very honest and looms as a strong winning hope again.",
